    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Operational design domain</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">기능이 작동하도록 설계된 도로·지역·속도·환경 조건과 경계다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The roadway, geography, speed and environmental conditions and limits for which a feature is designed to operate.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
